{"title":"Bandit","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 14 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 15 times (1.9% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>22</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>143</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>256</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>434</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>380</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>32</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>14</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>29</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>30</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=12\" title=\"Pick level 12\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>22</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Colossus%20Ruins\">Colossus Ruins</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=13\" title=\"Pick level 13\"><td><b>13</b></td><td>40</td><td>11.7</td><td>650</td><td class=\"muted\">120 · 16.4 · 1,950</td><td>143</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Havenheim\">Havenheim</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=14\" title=\"Pick level 14\"><td><b>14</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>43</td><td>12.2</td><td>700</td><td class=\"muted\">129 · 17.1 · 2,100</td><td>256</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Havenheim\">Havenheim</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=15\" title=\"Pick level 15\"><td><b>15</b></td><td>46</td><td>12.8</td><td>750</td><td class=\"muted\">138 · 17.9 · 2,250</td><td>434</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Havenheim\">Havenheim</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=16\" title=\"Pick level 16\"><td><b>16</b></td><td>50</td><td>13.3</td><td>800</td><td class=\"muted\">150 · 18.6 · 2,400</td><td>380</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Bandit%20Camp\">Bandit Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/bandit?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>